{"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "query": "Unit tests for an Arduino Uno module: Snake game on four MAX7219 LED matrices with an analog joystick. Pins: pin 12 OUTPUT MAX7219 DIN; pin 10 OUTPUT MAX7219 CLK; pin 11 OUTPUT MAX7219 CS; pin 14 INPUT joystick vertical (A0), up = low values; pin 15 INPUT joystick horizontal (A1), left = low values. Arduino API used: analogRead, digitalWrite, pinMode, random, randomSeed, shiftOut, sizeof. Libraries: none. Library API used: none. Simulated devices: wokwi-max7219-matrix, wokwi-analog-joystick. Functions to test: void snake_init(), void snake_init_seeded(unsigned long seed), void snake_input_read(), void snake_input_apply(int raw_dy, int raw_dx), void snake_loop_pass(), STEP_RESULT snake_step(), void snake_render_init(), void snake_render_field(), DIRECTION snake_next_move(), Game* snake_game(), int snake_loop_filter(), uint8_t snake_led_row(uint8_t panel, uint8_t row), void game_init(Game *game), void game_prepare_level(Game *game), STEP_RESULT game_handle_next_step(Game *game, UserInput *input), bool is_next_snake_point_allowed(Game *game, Point point), Point get_next_point(Point point, DIRECTION direction), DIRECTION get_opposite_direction(DIRECTION direction), void set_snake_direction(Game *game, DIRECTION direction).", "embedding": [-0.0249176025390625, -0.0102691650390625, -0.0207977294921875, -0.007709503173828125, -0.01552581787109375, 0.01543426513671875, -0.0006594657897949219, -0.038421630859375, 0.016998291015625, -0.00386810302734375, 0.03607177734375, -0.057769775390625, -0.045135498046875, 0.046478271484375, 0.019744873046875, 0.0009202957153320312, 0.04486083984375, 0.004283905029296875, -0.0263519287109375, 0.0193634033203125, 0.0596923828125, -0.0028705596923828125, 0.0428466796875, 0.01171112060546875, 0.004070281982421875, -0.0151824951171875, 0.040802001953125, 0.041748046875, 0.0274200439453125, -0.02001953125, 0.030975341796875, -0.004596710205078125, 0.028717041015625, 0.007312774658203125, -0.056701